Package: napi-mac
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Maintainer: NapiLab <info@napilab.ru>
Homepage: https://github.com/lab240/napi-macs-from-eeprom
Description: MAC addresses from the NAPI board EEPROM
 Assigns the MAC addresses stored in the on-board NAPI EEPROM (layout v3)
 to the W5500 and USB Ethernet interfaces of NAPI RK3308 boards, from udev
 rules and a one-shot service at boot, and names the interfaces
 lanusb1..4 / lanw5500 by host controller and port.
 .
 Configuration: /etc/napi/mac.conf. Check: napi-set-mac --check.
